s9::df-borrows |- borrows = ( l e. Word 2o |-> if ( ( toNat ` l ) = 0 , ( # ` l ) , ( 2 pCnt ( toNat ` l ) ) ) )
s10:c6,s9:fvmptg |- ( ( L e. Word 2o /\ if ( ( toNat ` L ) = 0 , ( # ` L ) , ( 2 pCnt ( toNat ` L ) ) ) e. _V ) -> ( borrows ` L ) = if ( ( toNat ` L ) = 0 , ( # ` L ) , ( 2 pCnt ( toNat ` L ) ) ) )
